  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Deep Research**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of Phase 2, meticulously cross-referencing the requirements outlined in `planning-mode/SKILL.md`. The skill check is progressing well; the `gemini-api` is already fully functional, API and persistence skills are already in place, but I want to dive deeper to explore all the facets.\n\n\n**Analyzing Gemini Integration**\n\nI\'ve been examining the integration of `gemini-4-hydrogen` for server-side summarization. I\'m focusing on its capabilities for commit summaries, PR descriptions, and interactive Q&A. The free-tier status is a key factor, and I\'ve noted the necessary upgrade to `@google/genai` during the build phase. Now I\'m preparing to review `fundamentals.md`, `geometry.md`, `interaction.md`, and `lighting.md` to refresh my threejs skills for the Floating Island Roadmap.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "N8ACa-6MCpmdur8P3LGC0As"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_17547099121796489922"
