24\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n                   \342\226\274                                      \342\226\274\n       \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220               \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\n       \342\224\202  GitHub REST API v3  \342\224\202               \342\224\202  Gemini 4 Hydrogen API \342\224\202\n       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230               \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\n```\n\n### Data Model & State\n\n- **Repository Snapshot**: Core metadata (`owner`, `name`, `description`, `stars`, `forks`, `openIssues`, `language`, `pushedAt`, `htmlUrl`), `latestRelease` (tag, name, published date, raw notes), `recentReleases` (up to 4 for 3D milestone towers), `commits` (latest 15 commits with SHA, message, author, avatar, timestamp), `mergedPRs` (latest 10 merged pull requests), `contributors` (top 8 contributors with avatar and contribution count), and `velocitySeries` (14-day / weekly commit & PR momentum buckets for animated charts).\n- **AI Community Digest**: Structured response returned by Gemini containing `headline`, `playfulSummary`, `momentumMood`, `releaseHighlights` (plain-English bullet list), `commitTranslations` (keyed by SHA with `emoji`, `plainTitle`, `whyItMatters`, `category`), and `prTranslations` (keyed by PR number).\n- **Live Sync & Milestone State**: Tracks `lastSyncedAt`, `nextSyncSeconds` (60s countdown), `isSyncing`, `autoSyncEnabled`, `notificationPermission`, `lastSeenCommitSha`, `lastSeenReleaseTag`, and a queue of celebratory milestone alerts.\n- **3D Island Lifecycle State**: Maps real repository data onto the Floating Island:\n  - Releases \342\206\222 Multi-part Lighthouse Towers along the winding island road.\n  - Merged PRs \342\206\222 Coastal Workshop Pavilions with glowing banners.\n  - Recent Commits \342\206\222 Orbiting Energy Pods circling the active frontier station.\n  - Selected Station \342\206\222 Smoothly glides camera via exponential damping and opens an interactive inspector card with a one-click \"Ask AI to explain this\" action.\n\n### Interactive Component & State Mapping\n\n- **Repo Input & Validation**: Normalizes `https://github.com/facebook/react/`, `github.com/facebook/react`, or `facebook/react` into `owner/repo`, validates format inline, triggers fetch + AI summary pipeline, and saves recently viewed repos to `localStorage` for quick switching.\n- **Auto-Sync & Milestone Diffing**: Every 60 seconds (when enabled), polls `/api/github/repo?repo=...&sync=1`; if a newer commit SHA, merged PR, or release tag arrives, automatically refreshes the AI summary, increments metrics, triggers a 3D celebration burst on the island, and dispatches both a native browser notification (if granted) and an in-app celebratory banner. Clicking **Test Milestone Alert** exercises the exact same notification + 3D celebration flow safely without mutating real GitHub data.\n- **Interactive Feed Filtering & Jargon Toggle**: Filter buttons (`All`, `Commits`, `Merged PRs`) dynamically filter the activity stream; each entry toggles between the playful plain-English view and the original technical commit/PR details, plus a quick \"Ask AI\" trigger that opens the chat pre-loaded with context on that exact item.\n- **3D Camera Dock & Raycasting**: Bottom dock controls switch camera presets (`Island Overview`, `Release Towers`, `PR Harbor`, `Commit Orbit`), toggle island auto-orbit, and collapse/expand the dock cleanly; hovering/clicking any 3D station highlights it and synchronizes with the station inspector panel.\n- **Streaming Community AI Chat**: Maintains conversation history per repository, streams live tokens from `/api/ai/chat`, and resets gracefully when switching repositories while handling API errors with clear retry buttons.\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///.aistudio/artifacts/brain/3801c218-cd07-4f01-93ae-3476e008fa5c/implementation_plan.md"
        }
        overwrite: true
