              text: "PulseIsle turns raw GitHub repository activity into a cheerful, jargon-free community hub for non-technical stakeholders and open-source fans. Visitors paste any GitHub URL or `owner/repo` handle to explore live velocity charts, AI-translated commit and release briefings, an interactive 3D Floating Island Roadmap built with Three.js, live 60-second auto-sync with milestone push notifications, and a friendly AI guide they can chat with anytime."
