            lines {
              text: "## 1. Overview & Core Concept"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **What It Does**: Connects live to any public GitHub repository, fetches commits, recently merged pull requests, release notes, contributor leaderboards, and development velocity metrics, then uses Gemini AI (`gemini-4-hydrogen`) to translate cryptic engineering updates into upbeat, plain-English stories and actionable takeaways."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Target Audience / Persona**: Open-source community members, product stakeholders, donors, and non-technical followers who eagerly track a project\'s momentum without wanting to read diffs or decode developer jargon."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Key Value**: Bridges the gap between engineering execution and community excitement\342\200\224combining automated real-time progress reporting, tactile animated charts, interactive 3D storytelling, and an always-ready AI explainer chat in one responsive workspace."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 2. User Experience & Visual Design"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Key User Flows"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Launcher Arrival (Zero-State)**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Visitors land on an airy, sunlit hero search screen with a single bold input accepting either `https://github.com/owner/repo` or `owner/repo`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Directly below sit four curated open-source starter cards (e.g., `facebook/react`, `vercel/next.js`, `vitejs/vite`, `mrdoob/three.js`) displaying live-ready launch affordances so anyone can jump straight into a real repository in one click."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Active Repository Dashboard**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Top Bar**: Clean three-zone navigation\342\200\224brand wordmark on the left, concise section links (`Overview`, `3D Roadmap`, `Updates`, `Community`) in the center, and a single primary `Switch Repo` action on the right."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Hero Briefing & Sync Strip**: Displays the repository identity, a cheerful AI-written \"Community Pulse\" headline and plain-English TL;DR, milestone progress bars (toward next release/velocity target), and a quiet sync toolbar with the 60-second auto-sync toggle, notification permission button, and **Test Milestone Alert** button."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Interactive 3D Floating Island Roadmap**: A wide, unobstructed Three.js daylight viewport where visitors orbit, zoom, and click procedural 3D milestone stations representing releases, recent merged PR hubs, and orbiting commit pods. A sleek collapsible bottom dock lets users switch camera views (`Overview`, `Latest Release`, `Recent PRs`, `Contributors`), replay a milestone celebration burst, or toggle Zen Mode without side-panel clutter covering the island. Clicking any 3D station opens a concise floating caption card and lets the user \"Ask AI about this milestone.\""
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - **Plain-English Activity Feed & Release Spotlight**: Side-by-side or stacked responsive layout showing:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     - **Latest Release Notes** translated into celebratory community takeaways with friendly emoji markers."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
