  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Phase 3**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in Phase 3, the execution plan. My focus is on synthesizing the confirmed Phase 1 choices with careful consideration. I\'m now picturing a \"Floating Island Roadmap with milestone stations\", set against a \"Bright playful daylight canvas with vibrant coral\". This metaphor is starting to crystallize in my mind.\n\n\n**Refining Core Functionality**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the core functionality. Initial design includes a clean search bar with curated repository cards. I\'m aiming for auto-sync every 60 seconds, accompanied by browser alerts for notifications. I\'ve chosen \"PulseIsle\" as the app name. Express backend with Vite middlewares is the current architecture, specifically utilizing `server.ts`. I need to review environment constraints and confirm Node version compatibility. Packages include `three`, `@types/three`, `recharts`, and `@google/genai@latest` (needing version check for `gemini-4-hydrogen`).\n\n\n**Outlining the AI Integration**\n\nI\'m now outlining how the AI integration will work. The plan is for AI (specifically `gemini-4-hydrogen`) to automatically summarize each commit in natural language, acting as a simplified progress report for non-technical stakeholders. It will also synchronize with the repository to auto-update progress with each release. I also want a playful tone, animations and real-time push notifications. Interactive AI chat will allow questions about the project, alongside Three.js visualizations.\n\n\n**Inspecting Package Details**\n\nI\'m now carefully inspecting the `package.json` file. I\'ll batch install all runtime and `@types/*` dependencies with a single call, ensuring they\'re all non-dev dependencies. I\'m also preparing to simultaneously view `/package.json` and update `metadata.json`, `index.html`, `.env.example`, and `src/index.css`. Additionally, I\'m verifying the Google Fonts integration in `index.html`, specifically confirming the loading of `Bricolage Grotesque`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`, and `JetBrains Mono` with the specified weights.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "n8MCa_OtA4m3ur8P39bd8As"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12878237537047856440"
