  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Island Component**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation of the `FloatingIsland3D.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on strict adherence to the Three.js architectural and quality standards detailed in `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md`. Specifically, I\'m starting with the Software-WebGL Guard to ensure compatibility and stability.\n\n\n**Adjusting Rendering Strategies**\n\nI\'m now adapting the rendering strategy for software WebGL. I\'m focusing on probing the WebGL2 renderer string and carefully adjusting parameters like `antialias`, `pixelRatio`, and `shadowMap.enabled` based on the environment. Importantly, the scene\'s core elements\342\200\224geometry, lighting, and layout\342\200\224must remain consistent across GPU and software WebGL. I\'m also ensuring efficient frame pacing.\n\n\n**Building Island Elements**\n\nI\'m now focused on the island\'s composition. I\'m prioritizing the avoidance of single primitives, instead opting for complex geometries. I\'m building a multi-tier rock underside with organic strata. The grassy meadow will utilize a beveled cylinder with a procedural grass texture, and a glowing coral-and-teal milestone road will use a `TubeGeometry` along a `CatmullRomCurve3`. I\'m also considering hovering sub-islets.\n\n\n**Composing Scene Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating several new components. I\'ve been focusing on three recent merged pull requests. First, I\'m working with the new \"Workshop Pavilions\" elements. Then, I\'m dealing with the \"Contributor Plaza Monument,\" and finally the \"Orbiting Commit Energy Pods\" that are meant to hover gently above the island pathway. I\'m also preparing to use `THREE.InstancedMesh` for meadow trees, boulders, and daylight clouds. I\'m carefully managing the interplay of emissive materials, transparent components, and metallic elements.\n\n\n**Adding Visual Flair**\n\nI\'m now adding visual enhancements to the scene. I\'m focusing on cypress and pine foliage cones that are multi-tiered and slightly varied in scale, with a subtle emerald/sage tinting. Plus, I\'m working on drifting, puffy cloud clusters near the horizon.\n\\n\\n\nI\'m also adding milestone celebration fireworks and confetti! There\'s a pre-allocated pool of 70 confetti particles launched skyward with gravity and sparkle whenever `celebrationSignal` increments from auto-sync discovery, the \"Test Milestone Alert,\" or the \"Celebrate\" button.\n\nI\'m implementing invisible proxy collision spheres on layer 1 for every interactive landmark, and optimizing for snappy and zero-lag hovering and clicking. I\'m throttling hover detection to optimize for smooth user experience, and distinguishing orbit drag from clicks using a pointer delta. Finally, I\'m implementing smooth camera gliding using exponential damping.\n\n\n**Designing UI Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now designing the user interface mechanics. I\'m focusing on zero-occlusion ergonomics, isolating the WebGL canvas within its own `div` to handle context events, and avoiding backdrop filters for crisp UI cards. There will be a collapsible bottom dock, and a dismissible top-left station inspector card for landmark info. The focus is on a snappy, non-obtrusive layout.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "g8YCa-KdGPC5ur8PiOi0kQM"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7583003359659883427"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useEffect, useMemo, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\nimport { OrbitControls } from \'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js\';\\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from \'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js\';\\nimport {\\n  ChevronDown,\\n  ChevronUp,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  MessageCircle,\\n  PartyPopper,\\n  RotateCw,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport type { AiDigest, IslandStation, RepoSnapshot } from \'../types\';\\nimport { formatCompactNumber, formatRelativeTime } from \'../utils/format\';\\n\\ninterface FloatingIsland3DProps {\\n  snapshot: RepoSnapshot;\\n  digest: AiDigest | null;\\n  celebrationSignal: number;\\n  onAskAboutStation: (prompt: string, contextLabel: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\ntype CameraPresetId = \'overview\' | \'releases\' | \'prs\' | \'commits\' | \'contributors\';\\n\\nconst CAMERA_PRESETS: Record<\\n  CameraPresetId,\\n  { label: string; pos: [number, number, number]; target: [number, number, number] }\\n> = {\\n  overview: { label: \'Island Overview\', pos: [14.5, 10.2, 15.5], target: [0, 1.4, 0] },\\n  releases: { label: \'Release Peak\', pos: [6.8, 7.6, 8.2], target: [0.5, 3.6, -2.1] },\\n  prs: { label: \'PR Harbor\', pos: [-9.2, 6.0, 9.8], target: [-3.4, 1.4, 1.4] },\\n  commits: { label: \'Commit Orbit\', pos: [10.4, 6.8, 7.6], target: [3.2, 2.2, 1.6] },\\n  contributors: { label: \'Builders Plaza\', pos: [-6.4, 6.2, -9.8], target: [-1.4, 1.8, -2.4] },\\n};\\n\\n// Reusable per-frame math helpers (zero GC inside animation loop)\\nconst _camGoalPos = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _camGoalTarget = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _dummyMatrix = new THREE.Matrix4();\\nconst _dummyPos = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _dummyQuat = new THREE.Quaternion();\\nconst _dummyScale = new THREE.Vector3();\\nconst _dummyEuler = new THREE.Euler();\\nconst _color = new THREE.Color();\\n\\nfunction createMeadowTexture(maxAnisotropy: number): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 512;\\n  canvas.height = 512;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n\\n  const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(256, 256, 30, 256, 256, 256);\\n  grad.addColorStop(0, \'#6EE7B7\');\\n  grad.addColorStop(0.55, \'#34D399\');\\n  grad.addColorStop(0.88, \'#10B981\');\\n  grad.addColorStop(1, \'#0D9488\');\\n  ctx.fillStyle = grad;\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 512, 512);\\n\\n  // Organic sunlit grass flecks\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 650; i++) {\\n    const x = Math.random() * 512;\\n    const y = Math.random() * 512;\\n    const r = 2 + Math.random() * 6;\\n    ctx.fillStyle = i % 3 === 0 ? \'rgba(254, 249, 195, 0.18)\' : \'rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.10)\';\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.arc(x, y, r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    ctx.fill();\\n  }\\n\\n  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n  tex.anisotropy = maxAnisotropy;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\\n\\nfunction createLighthouseTexture(maxAnisotropy: number): THREE.CanvasTexture {\\n  const canvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n  canvas.width = 256;\\n  canvas.height = 256;\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\')!;\\n\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#FFFDF9\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, 256, 256);\\n\\n  // Cheerful coral stripes\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \'#FF5A5F\';\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 42, 256, 44);\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 140, 256, 46);\\n\\n  // Subtle architectural panel lines\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)\';\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n  for (let y = 0; y < 256; y += 32) {\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.moveTo(0, y);\\n    ctx.lineTo(256, y);\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  }\\n\\n  const tex = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\\n  tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n  tex.anisotropy = maxAnisotropy;\\n  tex.needsUpdate = true;\\n  return tex;\\n}\\n\\n// Composite 7-part procedural Lighthouse Tower for GitHub Releases\\nfunction buildReleaseLighthouse(\\n  scale: number,\\n  stripeTex: THREE.CanvasTexture,\\n  castShadow: boolean\\n): THREE.Group {\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n\\n  // 1. Octagonal stone plinth (bottom-center pivot at y = 0)\\n  const plinthMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xe2e8f0,\\n    roughness: 0.88,\\n    metalness: 0.04,\\n  });\\n  const plinth = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.72, 0.88, 0.42, 8), plinthMat);\\n  plinth.position.y = 0.21;\\n  plinth.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  plinth.receiveShadow = true;\\n  group.add(plinth);\\n\\n  // 2. Tapered striped lighthouse body\\n  const bodyMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    map: stripeTex,\\n    roughness: 0.55,\\n    metalness: 0.05,\\n  });\\n  const body = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.42, 0.64, 2.0, 16), bodyMat);\\n  body.position.y = 1.42;\\n  body.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  body.receiveShadow = true;\\n  group.add(body);\\n\\n  // 3. Brushed brass observation deck & gallery rail\\n  const brassMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xf59e0b,\\n    roughness: 0.24,\\n    metalness: 0.82,\\n  });\\n  const deck = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.56, 0.52, 0.14, 16), brassMat);\\n  deck.position.y = 2.48;\\n  deck.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  group.add(deck);\\n\\n  const rail = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.52, 0.035, 8, 24), brassMat);\\n  rail.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\\n  rail.position.y = 2.66;\\n  group.add(rail);\\n\\n  // 4. Warm glowing beacon core\\n  const beaconMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xfef3c7,\\n    emissive: 0xf59e0b,\\n    emissiveIntensity: 1.5,\\n    roughness: 0.2,\\n  });\\n  const core = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.24, 0.24, 0.44, 12), beaconMat);\\n  core.position.y = 2.78;\\n  group.add(core);\\n\\n  // 5. Outer crystal lantern glass\\n  const glassMat = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\\n    color: 0xffffff,\\n    roughness: 0.08,\\n    metalness: 0.1,\\n    transparent: true,\\n    opacity: 0.42,\\n    depthWrite: false,\\n    clearcoat: 1.0,\\n  });\\n  const glass = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.36, 0.36, 0.52, 12), glassMat);\\n  glass.position.y = 2.78;\\n  glass.renderOrder = 3;\\n  group.add(glass);\\n\\n  // 6. Teal copper conical roof cap\\n  const roofMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0x0d9488,\\n    roughness: 0.35,\\n    metalness: 0.58,\\n  });\\n  const roof = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(0.48, 0.55, 16), roofMat);\\n  roof.position.y = 3.3;\\n  roof.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  group.add(roof);\\n\\n  // 7. Top spire finial\\n  const finial = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.09, 12, 12), brassMat);\\n  finial.position.y = 3.62;\\n  group.add(finial);\\n\\n  group.scale.setScalar(scale);\\n  return group;\\n}\\n\\n// Composite 7-part Workshop Pavilion for Merged Pull Requests\\nfunction buildPrPavilion(accentHex: number, castShadow: boolean): THREE.Group {\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n\\n  const woodMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xd9a066,\\n    roughness: 0.78,\\n    metalness: 0.02,\\n  });\\n  const roofMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: accentHex,\\n    roughness: 0.42,\\n    metalness: 0.18,\\n  });\\n  const metalMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0x475569,\\n    roughness: 0.3,\\n    metalness: 0.75,\\n  });\\n  const crateMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xfef3c7,\\n    emissive: accentHex,\\n    emissiveIntensity: 0.35,\\n    roughness: 0.45,\\n  });\\n\\n  // 1. Timber platform base\\n  const deck = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(1.45, 0.18, 1.2), woodMat);\\n  deck.position.y = 0.09;\\n  deck.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  deck.receiveShadow = true;\\n  group.add(deck);\\n\\n  // 2-5. Four support posts\\n  const postGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.055, 0.06, 1.05, 8);\\n  const offsets: [number, number][] = [\\n    [-0.58, -0.46],\\n    [0.58, -0.46],\\n    [-0.58, 0.46],\\n    [0.58, 0.46],\\n  ];\\n  for (const [px, pz] of offsets) {\\n    const post = new THREE.Mesh(postGeo, woodMat);\\n    post.position.set(px, 0.7, pz);\\n    post.castShadow = castShadow;\\n    group.add(post);\\n  }\\n\\n  // 6. Slanted canopy roof\\n  const roof = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(1.12, 0.56, 4), roofMat);\\n  roof.rotation.y = Math.PI / 4;\\n  roof.scale.set(1.08, 1, 0.92);\\n  roof.position.y = 1.48;\\n  roof.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  group.add(roof);\\n\\n  // 7. Merged package glowing core + flag mast\\n  const crate = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.46, 0.42, 0.46), crateMat);\\n  crate.position.set(0, 0.39, 0);\\n  crate.rotation.y = 0.35;\\n  crate.castShadow = castShadow;\\n  group.add(crate);\\n\\n  const mast = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.025, 0.025, 0.75, 6), metalMat);\\n  mast.position.set(0, 1.98, 0);\\n  group.add(mast);\\n\\n  const pennantShape = new THREE.Shape();\\n  pennantShape.moveTo(0, 0);\\n  pennantShape.lineTo(0.45, 0.12);\\n  pennantShape.lineTo(0, 0.24);\\n  pennantShape.closePath();\\n  const pennantGeo = new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(pennantShape, { depth: 0.02, bevelEnabled: false });\\n  const pennant = new THREE.Mesh(pennantGeo, roofMat);\\n  pennant.position.set(0.02, 2.08, -0.01);\\n  group.add(pennant);\\n\\n  return group;\\n}\\n\\n// Composite 3-part Commit Energy Pod\\nfunction buildCommitPod(colorHex: number): THREE.Group {\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n\\n  const crystalMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: colorHex,\\n    emissive: colorHex,\\n    emissiveIntensity: 0.45,\\n    roughness: 0.2,\\n    metalness: 0.35,\\n  });\\n  const ringMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n    color: 0xffffff,\\n    roughness: 0.22,\\n    metalness: 0.85,\\n  });\\n\\n  const crystal = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.OctahedronGeometry(0.28, 0), crystalMat);\\n  crystal.scale.set(1, 1.35, 1);\\n  group.add(crystal);\\n\\n  const ring = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.4, 0.032, 8, 20), ringMat);\\n  ring.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2.6;\\n  group.add(ring);\\n\\n  const cap = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.08, 10, 10), ringMat);\\n  cap.position.y = 0.42;\\n  group.add(cap);\\n\\n  return group;\\n}\\n\\nexport function FloatingIsland3D({\\n  snapshot,\\n  digest,\\n  celebrationSignal,\\n  onAskAboutStation,\\n}: FloatingIsland3DProps) {\\n  const mountRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const [selectedStation, setSelectedStation] = useState<IslandStation | null>(null);\\n  const [activePreset, setActivePreset] = useState<CameraPresetId>(\'overview\');\\n  const [autoRotate, setAutoRotate] = useState(true);\\n  const [dockCollapsed, setDockCollapsed] = useState(false);\\n  const [webglUnavailable, setWebglUnavailable] = useState(false);\\n\\n  // Refs synced to the Three.js loop so UI toggles never tear down the WebGL context\\n  const autoRotateRef = useRef(autoRotate);\\n  const cameraGoalRef = useRef<{\\n    active: boolean;\\n    pos: [number, number, number];\\n    target: [number, number, number];\\n  }>({\\n    active: false,\\n    pos: CAMERA_PRESETS.overview.pos,\\n    target: CAMERA_PRESETS.overview.target,\\n  });\\n  const burstTriggerRef = useRef<() => void>(() => {});\\n  const onSelectStationRef = useRef<(station: IslandStation | null) => void>(setSelectedStation);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    autoRotateRef.current = autoRotate;\\n  }, [autoRotate]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    onSelectStationRef.current = setSelectedStation;\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Build semantic station descriptors grounded in live GitHub + AI data\\n  const stations = useMemo<IslandStation[]>(() => {\\n    const list: IslandStation[] = [];\\n\\n    // 1. Releases -> Lighthouse Summit\\n    const rels = snapshot.releases.slice(0, 3);\\n    const relPositions: [number, number, number][] = [\\n      [0.4, 2.25, -2.0],\\n      [-2.1, 1.85, -3.2],\\n      [2.6, 1.8, -2.9],\\n    ];\\n    if (rels.length > 0) {\\n      rels.forEach((rel, i) => {\\n        const pos = relPositions[i];\\n        const aiRel = i === 0 ? digest?.releaseTranslation : null;\\n        list.push({\\n          id: `release-${rel.id || i}`,\\n          kind: \'release\',\\n          title: aiRel?.cheerfulTitle || `${rel.tagName} Release Beacon`,\\n          subtitle: `${rel.tagName} \302\267 Published ${formatRelativeTime(rel.publishedAt)}`,\\n          emoji: \'\360\237\227\274\',\\n          detail:\\n            aiRel?.summary ||\\n            rel.body.slice(0, 170) ||\\n            `Milestone release ${rel.tagName} shipped by ${rel.authorLogin}.`,\\n          meta: `Release ${rel.tagName} by @${rel.authorLogin}`,\\n          url: rel.htmlUrl,\\n          cameraPos: [pos[0] + 4.8, pos[1] + 4.4, pos[2] + 6.4],\\n          lookAt: [pos[0], pos[1] + 1.4, pos[2]],\\n        });\\n      });\\n    } else {\\n      list.push({\\n        id: \'release-main\',\\n        kind: \'release\',\\n        title: `${snapshot.repo.name} Summit Beacon`,\\n        subtitle: `Branch ${snapshot.repo.defaultBranch} \302\267 Active development`,\\n        emoji: \'\360\237\227\274\',\\n        detail:\\n          digest?.nextMilestoneEstimate ||\\n          \'Building momentum on the main branch toward the next big community milestone!\',\\n        meta: `${formatCompactNumber(snapshot.repo.stars)} stars \302\267 ${snapshot.repo.language}`,\\n        url: snapshot.repo.htmlUrl,\\n        cameraPos: [5.4, 6.8, 5.8],\\n        lookAt: [0.4, 3.2, -2.0],\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    // 2. Merged PRs -> Workshop Pavilions\\n    const prs = snapshot.mergedPRs.slice(0, 3);\\n    const prPositions: [number, number, number][] = [\\n      [-3.5, 0.75, 1.5],\\n      [-1.4, 0.75, 3.3],\\n      [-4.2, 0.75, -0.7],\\n    ];\\n    prs.forEach((pr, i) => {\\n      const pos = prPositions[i];\\n      const aiPr = digest?.prTranslations.find((t) => t.number === pr.number);\\n      list.push({\\n        id: `pr-${pr.number}`,\\n        kind: \'pr\',\\n        title: aiPr?.plainTitle || pr.title,\\n        subtitle: `Merged PR #${pr.number} \302\267 ${formatRelativeTime(pr.mergedAt)}`,\\n        emoji: aiPr?.emoji || \'\360\237\233\240\357\270\217\',\\n        detail:\\n          aiPr?.whyItMatters ||\\n          `Community improvement merged by @${pr.userLogin} directly into ${snapshot.repo.name}.`,\\n        meta: `PR #${pr.number} by @${pr.userLogin}`,\\n        url: pr.htmlUrl,\\n        cameraPos: [pos[0] - 3.2, pos[1] + 4.2, pos[2] + 5.8],\\n        lookAt: [pos[0], pos[1] + 0.9, pos[2]],\\n      });\\n    });\\n\\n    // 3. Recent Commits -> Orbiting Commit Frontier\\n    const latestCommit = snapshot.commits[0];\\n    if (latestCommit) {\\n      const aiCommit = digest?.commitTranslations.find((c) => c.sha === latestCommit.shortSha);\\n      list.push({\\n        id: `commit-${latestCommit.shortSha}`,\\n        kind: \'commit\',\\n        title: aiCommit?.plainTitle || latestCommit.firstLine,\\n        subtitle: `Latest commit ${latestCommit.shortSha} \302\267 ${formatRelativeTime(latestCommit.date)}`,\\n        emoji: aiCommit?.emoji || \'\342\232\241\',\\n        detail:\\n          aiCommit?.whyItMatters ||\\n          `Fresh code landed by @${latestCommit.authorLogin}, keeping the project lively and moving forward.`,\\n        meta: `${snapshot.commits.length} recent commits orbiting the frontier`,\\n        url: latestCommit.htmlUrl,\\n        cameraPos: [8.8, 5.8, 6.2],\\n        lookAt: [3.2, 2.0, 1.5],\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    // 4. Contributors -> Builders Plaza\\n    const topContrib = snapshot.contributors[0];\\n    if (topContrib) {\\n      list.push({\\n        id: \'contributors-plaza\',\\n        kind: \'contributor\',\\n        title: \'Community Builders Plaza\',\\n        subtitle: `Led by @${topContrib.login} (${formatCompactNumber(topContrib.contributions)} contributions)`,\\n        emoji: \'\360\237\217\206\',\\n        detail: `Honoring the top ${snapshot.contributors.length} contributors shaping ${snapshot.repo.fullName}\342\200\224pillar heights reflect their real contribution counts!`,\\n        meta: `${formatCompactNumber(snapshot.repo.forks)} forks \302\267 ${formatCompactNumber(snapshot.repo.stars)} stars`,\\n        url: topContrib.htmlUrl,\\n        cameraPos: [-5.6, 5.8, -8.8],\\n        lookAt: [-1.2, 1.5, -2.0],\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    return list;\\n  }, [snapshot, digest]);\\n\\n  const stationsRef = useRef<IslandStation[]>(stations);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    stationsRef.current = stations;\\n  }, [stations]);\\n\\n  // Trigger 3D firework burst whenever celebrationSignal bumps\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (celebrationSignal > 0) {\\n      burstTriggerRef.current();\\n    }\\n  }, [celebrationSignal]);\\n\\n  // Mount Three.js scene once per repository change\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const container = mountRef.current;\\n    if (!container) return;\\n\\n    // 1. Software-WebGL probe (exact pattern from Three.js skill)\\n    const isSoftwareGl = (() => {\\n      try {\\n        const probeCanvas = document.createElement(\'canvas\');\\n        const gl = probeCanvas.getContext(\'webgl2\');\\n        if (!gl) return true;\\n        const ext = gl.getExtension(\'WEBGL_debug_renderer_info\');\\n        const param = ext ? ext.UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL : gl.RENDERER;\\n        const gpu = String(gl.getParameter(param) || \'\');\\n        gl.getExtension(\'WEBGL_lose_context\')?.loseContext();\\n        return /SwiftShader|llvmpipe|softpipe|Software|Basic Render/i.test(gpu);\\n      } catch {\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    })();\\n\\n    let renderer: THREE.WebGLRenderer;\\n    try {\\n      renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\\n        antialias: !isSoftwareGl,\\n        powerPreference: \'high-performance\',\\n      });\\n    } catch {\\n      setWebglUnavailable(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setWebglUnavailable(false);\\n    renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\\n    renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;\\n    renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.08;\\n    renderer.setPixelRatio(isSoftwareGl ? 1 : Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\\n    renderer.shadowMap.enabled = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    renderer.shadowMap.type = THREE.PCFSoftShadowMap;\\n\\n    const width = container.clientWidth || 800;\\n    const height = container.clientHeight || 480;\\n    renderer.setSize(width, height);\\n    container.innerHTML = \'\';\\n    container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\\n\\n    const handleContextLost = (e: Event) => {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n    };\\n    renderer.domElement.addEventListener(\'webglcontextlost\', handleContextLost);\\n\\n    // 2. Scene, Sky Atmosphere, Fog & RoomEnvironment\\n    const scene = new THREE.Scene();\\n    scene.background = new THREE.Color(0xe6f3fa);\\n    scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0xe6f3fa, 0.0135);\\n\\n    const pmremGenerator = new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\\n    const envTexture = pmremGenerator.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(), 0.04).texture;\\n    scene.environment = envTexture;\\n    pmremGenerator.dispose();\\n\\n    // 3. Camera & OrbitControls\\n    const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(42, width / height, 0.2, 160);\\n    camera.position.set(...CAMERA_PRESETS.overview.pos);\\n\\n    const controls = new OrbitControls(camera, renderer.domElement);\\n    controls.target.set(...CAMERA_PRESETS.overview.target);\\n    controls.enableDamping = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    controls.dampingFactor = 0.06;\\n    controls.minDistance = 6.5;\\n    controls.maxDistance = 30;\\n    controls.maxPolarAngle = Math.PI * 0.48;\\n    controls.minPolarAngle = 0.22;\\n    controls.update();\\n\\n    const onControlStart = () => {\\n      cameraGoalRef.current.active = false;\\n    };\\n    controls.addEventListener(\'start\', onControlStart);\\n\\n    // 4. Balanced 3-Point Daylight Lighting\\n    const hemiLight = new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xdbf0ff, 0x7dd3b0, 0.95);\\n    hemiLight.position.set(0, 28, 0);\\n    scene.add(hemiLight);\\n\\n    const sunKey = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfff4dd, 1.85);\\n    sunKey.position.set(13, 20, 11);\\n    sunKey.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    sunKey.shadow.mapSize.width = 1024;\\n    sunKey.shadow.mapSize.height = 1024;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.near = 2;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.far = 48;\\n    const d = 13;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.left = -d;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.right = d;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.top = d;\\n    sunKey.shadow.camera.bottom = -d;\\n    sunKey.shadow.bias = -0.0005;\\n    sunKey.shadow.normalBias = 0.02;\\n    scene.add(sunKey);\\n\\n    const rimLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xff9b93, 0.52);\\n    rimLight.position.set(-14, 9, -12);\\n    scene.add(rimLight);\\n\\n    // 5. Procedural Textures\\n    const maxAniso = renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy();\\n    const meadowTex = createMeadowTexture(maxAniso);\\n    const stripeTex = createLighthouseTexture(maxAniso);\\n\\n    // Root island group (gently bobs in the daylight sky)\\n    const islandRoot = new THREE.Group();\\n    scene.add(islandRoot);\\n\\n    // --- 5A. Composite Sculpted Floating Island Base ---\\n    const rockLathePoints = [\\n      new THREE.Vector2(0.01, -5.2),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(1.4, -4.1),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(3.1, -2.8),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(5.2, -1.6),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(6.5, -0.55),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(6.8, 0.25),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(6.4, 0.52),\\n      new THREE.Vector2(0.01, 0.52),\\n    ];\\n    const rockGeo = new THREE.LatheGeometry(rockLathePoints, 12);\\n    const rockMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xd6c7b2,\\n      roughness: 0.92,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n      flatShading: true,\\n    });\\n    const islandRock = new THREE.Mesh(rockGeo, rockMat);\\n    islandRock.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    islandRock.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(islandRock);\\n\\n    // Lower strata accent belt\\n    const strataMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xb09e86,\\n      roughness: 0.94,\\n      flatShading: true,\\n    });\\n    const strataRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(5.6, 3.8, 1.35, 12), strataMat);\\n    strataRing.position.y = -1.75;\\n    islandRoot.add(strataRing);\\n\\n    // Main sunlit meadow deck\\n    const meadowMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      map: meadowTex,\\n      roughness: 0.78,\\n      metalness: 0.02,\\n    });\\n    const meadowTop = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(6.65, 6.85, 0.42, 28), meadowMat);\\n    meadowTop.position.y = 0.56;\\n    meadowTop.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(meadowTop);\\n\\n    // Raised Release Summit Terrace (north side)\\n    const summitStone = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(3.3, 3.85, 1.05, 14), rockMat);\\n    summitStone.position.set(0.3, 1.15, -2.25);\\n    summitStone.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    summitStone.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(summitStone);\\n\\n    const summitGrass = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(3.22, 3.35, 0.26, 20), meadowMat);\\n    summitGrass.position.set(0.3, 1.75, -2.25);\\n    summitGrass.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(summitGrass);\\n\\n    // Glowing Winding Milestone Roadmap Path (TubeGeometry along CatmullRomCurve3)\\n    const roadCurve = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3([\\n      new THREE.Vector3(-1.3, 0.84, -1.9),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(-3.6, 0.84, -0.4),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(-3.3, 0.84, 1.9),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(-0.8, 0.84, 3.2),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(2.8, 0.84, 2.3),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(3.7, 1.02, -0.2),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(2.1, 1.92, -1.8),\\n      new THREE.Vector3(0.4, 1.92, -2.0),\\n    ]);\\n    const roadGeo = new THREE.TubeGeometry(roadCurve, 64, 0.22, 8, false);\\n    roadGeo.scale(1, 0.28, 1);\\n    const roadMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xfff7ed,\\n      emissive: 0xff5a5f,\\n      emissiveIntensity: 0.14,\\n      roughness: 0.48,\\n      metalness: 0.08,\\n    });\\n    const roadMesh = new THREE.Mesh(roadGeo, roadMat);\\n    roadMesh.position.y = 0.62;\\n    roadMesh.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(roadMesh);\\n\\n    // Floating side pebble islets\\n    const sideIslets: { mesh: THREE.Group; baseY: number; phase: number }[] = [];\\n    const isletConfigs: { pos: [number, number, number]; scale: number }[] = [\\n      { pos: [-8.6, -1.1, 2.8], scale: 0.9 },\\n      { pos: [8.4, -0.6, -3.2], scale: 1.05 },\\n      { pos: [6.8, -1.8, 5.4], scale: 0.68 },\\n    ];\\n    isletConfigs.forEach((cfg, idx) => {\\n      const g = new THREE.Group();\\n      const base = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.ConeGeometry(1.1, 1.8, 7), rockMat);\\n      base.rotation.x = Math.PI;\\n      base.position.y = -0.9;\\n      g.add(base);\\n      const cap = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.12, 1.08, 0.28, 9), meadowMat);\\n      cap.position.y = 0.12;\\n      g.add(cap);\\n      g.position.set(...cfg.pos);\\n      g.scale.setScalar(cfg.scale);\\n      scene.add(g);\\n      sideIslets.push({ mesh: g, baseY: cfg.pos[1], phase: idx * 2.1 });\\n    });\\n\\n    // --- 5B. Interactive Landmark Proxy List (Layer 1 for fast raycasting) ---\\n    const clickableProxies: THREE.Mesh[] = [];\\n    const proxyMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ visible: false });\\n    const registerProxy = (\\n      stationId: string,\\n      pos: [number, number, number],\\n      radius: number,\\n      visualGroup: THREE.Object3D\\n    ) => {\\n      const proxy = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(radius, 10, 10), proxyMat);\\n      proxy.position.set(...pos);\\n      proxy.layers.set(1);\\n      proxy.userData = { stationId, visualGroup };\\n      islandRoot.add(proxy);\\n      clickableProxies.push(proxy);\\n    };\\n\\n    // --- 5C. Release Lighthouse Towers ---\\n    const relCoords: [number, number, number][] = [\\n      [0.4, 1.88, -2.0],\\n      [-2.1, 1.86, -3.2],\\n      [2.6, 1.84, -2.9],\\n    ];\\n    const releaseStations = stationsRef.current.filter((s) => s.kind === \'release\');\\n    releaseStations.forEach((st, idx) => {\\n      const coords = relCoords[idx] || relCoords[0];\\n      const tower = buildReleaseLighthouse(idx === 0 ? 1.05 : 0.78, stripeTex, !isSoftwareGl);\\n      tower.position.set(...coords);\\n      islandRoot.add(tower);\\n      registerProxy(st.id, [coords[0], coords[1] + 1.8, coords[2]], 1.45, tower);\\n    });\\n\\n    // --- 5D. Merged PR Workshop Pavilions ---\\n    const prCoords: [number, number, number][] = [\\n      [-3.5, 0.77, 1.5],\\n      [-1.4, 0.77, 3.3],\\n      [-4.2, 0.77, -0.7],\\n    ];\\n    const prColors = [0x0d9488, 0xff5a5f, 0x0ea5e9];\\n    const prStations = stationsRef.current.filter((s) => s.kind === \'pr\');\\n    prStations.forEach((st, idx) => {\\n      const coords = prCoords[idx];\\n      if (!coords) return;\\n      const pav = buildPrPavilion(prColors[idx % prColors.length], !isSoftwareGl);\\n      pav.position.set(...coords);\\n      pav.rotation.y = idx * 0.75 + 0.3;\\n      islandRoot.add(pav);\\n      registerProxy(st.id, [coords[0], coords[1] + 1.1, coords[2]], 1.3, pav);\\n    });\\n\\n    // --- 5E. Contributor Builders Plaza Monument ---\\n    const plazaGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n    plazaGroup.position.set(-1.3, 0.78, -0.1);\\n    const plazaBase = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.45, 1.58, 0.16, 16),\\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xf1f5f9, roughness: 0.75, metalness: 0.05 })\\n    );\\n    plazaBase.position.y = 0.08;\\n    plazaBase.receiveShadow = true;\\n    plazaGroup.add(plazaBase);\\n\\n    const topContribs = snapshot.contributors.slice(0, 5);\\n    const maxContrib = Math.max(1, ...topContribs.map((c) => c.contributions));\\n    const pillarColors = [0xf59e0b, 0xff5a5f, 0x0d9488, 0x38bdf8, 0x64748b];\\n    topContribs.forEach((c, idx) => {\\n      const ratio = 0.35 + (c.contributions / maxContrib) * 1.15;\\n      const angle = (idx / Math.max(1, topContribs.length)) * Math.PI * 2;\\n      const r = idx === 0 ? 0 : 0.78;\\n      const pMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n        color: pillarColors[idx % pillarColors.length],\\n        roughness: 0.32,\\n        metalness: idx === 0 ? 0.65 : 0.25,\\n      });\\n      const pillar = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.18, 0.22, ratio, 10), pMat);\\n      pillar.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * r, 0.16 + ratio / 2, Math.sin(angle) * r);\\n      pillar.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n      plazaGroup.add(pillar);\\n    });\\n    islandRoot.add(plazaGroup);\\n\\n    const contribStation = stationsRef.current.find((s) => s.kind === \'contributor\');\\n    if (contribStation) {\\n      registerProxy(contribStation.id, [-1.3, 1.5, -0.1], 1.45, plazaGroup);\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- 5F. Orbiting Commit Energy Pods ---\\n    const commitFrontierCenter = new THREE.Vector3(3.1, 1.7, 1.5);\\n    const commitPods: { group: THREE.Group; radius: number; speed: number; angle: number; yOff: number }[] = [];\\n    const podPalette = [0xff5a5f, 0x0d9488, 0xf59e0b, 0x0284c7];\\n    const commitCount = Math.min(8, Math.max(3, snapshot.commits.length));\\n\\n    // Frontier landing pad\\n    const frontierPad = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.35, 1.5, 0.18, 16),\\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x0d9488, roughness: 0.4, metalness: 0.45 })\\n    );\\n    frontierPad.position.set(commitFrontierCenter.x, 0.86, commitFrontierCenter.z);\\n    frontierPad.receiveShadow = true;\\n    islandRoot.add(frontierPad);\\n\\n    const orbitRing = new THREE.Mesh(\\n      new THREE.TorusGeometry(1.65, 0.035, 8, 40),\\n      new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n        color: 0xff5a5f,\\n        emissive: 0xff5a5f,\\n        emissiveIntensity: 0.35,\\n        roughness: 0.25,\\n        metalness: 0.7,\\n      })\\n    );\\n    orbitRing.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\\n    orbitRing.position.copy(commitFrontierCenter);\\n    islandRoot.add(orbitRing);\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < commitCount; i++) {\\n      const pod = buildCommitPod(podPalette[i % podPalette.length]);\\n      const angle = (i / commitCount) * Math.PI * 2;\\n      const radius = 1.2 + (i % 2) * 0.55;\\n      pod.position.set(\\n        commitFrontierCenter.x + Math.cos(angle) * radius,\\n        commitFrontierCenter.y + (i % 3) * 0.25,\\n        commitFrontierCenter.z + Math.sin(angle) * radius\\n      );\\n      islandRoot.add(pod);\\n      commitPods.push({\\n        group: pod,\\n        radius,\\n        speed: 0.42 + (i % 3) * 0.12,\\n        angle,\\n        yOff: (i % 3) * 0.24,\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    const commitStation = stationsRef.current.find((s) => s.kind === \'commit\');\\n    if (commitStation) {\\n      registerProxy(\\n        commitStation.id,\\n        [commitFrontierCenter.x, commitFrontierCenter.y + 0.3, commitFrontierCenter.z],\\n        1.7,\\n        orbitRing\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- 5G. Instanced Meadow Trees & Stylized Clouds ---\\n    const treePositions: [number, number, number][] = [\\n      [4.9, 0.77, -1.6],\\n      [5.3, 0.77, -0.4],\\n      [4.5, 0.77, -2.6],\\n      [1.8, 0.77, 4.7],\\n      [0.6, 0.77, 5.1],\\n      [-5.1, 0.77, 2.4],\\n      [-5.4, 0.77, 0.9],\\n      [-4.6, 0.77, -2.6],\\n      [-3.2, 0.77, -4.4],\\n      [3.9, 0.77, 3.8],\\n      [2.8, 0.77, 4.4],\\n      [-2.2, 0.77, 4.8],\\n      [5.5, 0.77, 1.3],\\n      [-0.4, 0.77, -5.2],\\n      [1.4, 0.77, -5.0],\\n      [3.6, 0.77, -4.2],\\n      [-4.9, 0.77, -1.7],\\n      [4.6, 0.77, 2.7],\\n      [-3.8, 0.77, 3.6],\\n      [0.8, 1.88, -3.9],\\n      [-0.8, 1.88, -3.8],\\n    ];\\n    const trunkGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.08, 0.12, 0.52, 6);\\n    const trunkMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x92400e, roughness: 0.9 });\\n    const canopyGeo = new THREE.ConeGeometry(0.42, 1.15, 7);\\n    const canopyMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xffffff, roughness: 0.78 });\\n\\n    const trunkInst = new THREE.InstancedMesh(trunkGeo, trunkMat, treePositions.length);\\n    const canopyInst = new THREE.InstancedMesh(canopyGeo, canopyMat, treePositions.length);\\n    canopyInst.castShadow = !isSoftwareGl;\\n    canopyInst.receiveShadow = true;\\n\\n    const leafPalette = [0x059669, 0x10b981, 0x0d9488, 0x14b8a6];\\n    treePositions.forEach(([tx, ty, tz], idx) => {\\n      const s = 0.85 + ((idx * 37) % 30) / 100; // \302\26115% scale variation\\n      _dummyPos.set(tx, ty + 0.26 * s, tz);\\n      _dummyEuler.set(0, idx * 1.1, 0);\\n      _dummyQuat.setFromEuler(_dummyEuler);\\n      _dummyScale.set(s, s, s);\\n      _dummyMatrix.compose(_dummyPos, _dummyQuat, _dummyScale);\\n      trunkInst.setMatrixAt(idx, _dummyMatrix);\\n\\n      _dummyPos.set(tx, ty + 0.92 * s, tz);\\n      _dummyMatrix.compose(_dummyPos, _dummyQuat, _dummyScale);\\n      canopyInst.setMatrixAt(idx, _dummyMatrix);\\n      _color.setHex(leafPalette[idx % leafPalette.length]);\\n      canopyInst.setColorAt(idx, _color);\\n    });\\n    trunkInst.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n    canopyInst.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n    if (canopyInst.instanceColor) canopyInst.instanceColor.needsUpdate = true;\\n    trunkInst.computeBoundingSphere();\\n    canopyInst.computeBoundingSphere();\\n    islandRoot.add(trunkInst);\\n    islandRoot.add(canopyInst);\\n\\n    // Stylized drifting horizon clouds\\n    const cloudGroup = new THREE.Group();\\n    const cloudMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xffffff,\\n      roughness: 0.95,\\n      metalness: 0.0,\\n    });\\n    const puffGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(1, 10, 10);\\n    const cloudDefs: [number, number, number, number][] = [\\n      [-14, 7.5, -12, 1.3],\\n      [15, 8.8, -10, 1.5],\\n      [13, 6.2, 12, 1.1],\\n      [-15, 5.8, 10, 1.2],\\n      [0, 10.5, -18, 1.6],\\n    ];\\n    cloudDefs.forEach(([cx, cy, cz, cs]) => {\\n      const c = new THREE.Group();\\n      const p1 = new THREE.Mesh(puffGeo, cloudMat);\\n      p1.scale.set(1.4, 0.72, 0.9);\\n      c.add(p1);\\n      const p2 = new THREE.Mesh(puffGeo, cloudMat);\\n      p2.position.set(1.0, -0.1, 0.15);\\n      p2.scale.set(0.95, 0.58, 0.78);\\n      c.add(p2);\\n      const p3 = new THREE.Mesh(puffGeo, cloudMat);\\n      p3.position.set(-0.95, -0.14, -0.1);\\n      p3.scale.set(0.9, 0.54, 0.76);\\n      c.add(p3);\\n      c.position.set(cx, cy, cz);\\n      c.scale.setScalar(cs);\\n      cloudGroup.add(c);\\n    });\\n    scene.add(cloudGroup);\\n\\n    // --- 5H. Celebration Confetti Particle Burst Pool (InstancedMesh) ---\\n    const PARTICLE_COUNT = 64;\\n    const confettiGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.16, 0.16, 0.04);\\n    const confettiMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\\n      color: 0xffffff,\\n      roughness: 0.35,\\n      metalness: 0.2,\\n    });\\n    const confettiMesh = new THREE.InstancedMesh(confettiGeo, confettiMat, PARTICLE_COUNT);\\n    confettiMesh.frustumCulled = false;\\n    confettiMesh.visible = false;\\n    const confettiColors = [0xff5a5f, 0x0d9488, 0xf59e0b, 0x38bdf8];\\n    const particles: {\\n      pos: THREE.Vector3;\\n      vel: THREE.Vector3;\\n      rot: THREE.Euler;\\n      life: number;\\n    }[] = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < PARTICLE_COUNT; i++) {\\n      particles.push({\\n        pos: new THREE.Vector3(0.4, 5.5, -2.0),\\n        vel: new THREE.Vector3(),\\n        rot: new THREE.Euler(),\\n        life: 0,\\n      });\\n      _color.setHex(confettiColors[i % confettiColors.length]);\\n      confettiMesh.setColorAt(i, _color);\\n    }\\n    if (confettiMesh.instanceColor) confettiMesh.instanceColor.needsUpdate = true;\\n    scene.add(confettiMesh);\\n\\n    let celebrationActive = false;\\n    burstTriggerRef.current = () => {\\n      celebrationActive = true;\\n      confettiMesh.visible = true;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < PARTICLE_COUNT; i++) {\\n        const p = particles[i];\\n        p.pos.set(0.4, 5.6, -2.0);\\n        const theta = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\\n        const speed = 2.4 + Math.random() * 4.2;\\n        p.vel.set(Math.cos(theta) * speed, 4.2 + Math.random() * 4.5, Math.sin(theta) * speed);\\n        p.rot.set(Math.random() * 3, Math.random() * 3, Math.random() * 3);\\n        p.life = 1.6 + Math.random() * 1.1;\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    // --- 6. Raycasting for Hover & Click Station Inspection ---\\n    const raycaster = new THREE.Raycaster();\\n    raycaster.layers.set(1);\\n    const pointerNdc = new THREE.Vector2();\\n    let hoveredProxy: THREE.Mesh | null = null;\\n    let lastMoveTs = 0;\\n    let downX = 0;\\n    let downY = 0;\\n\\n    const updatePointer = (ev: PointerEvent) => {\\n      const rect = renderer.domElement.getBoundingClientRect();\\n      pointerNdc.x = ((ev.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      pointerNdc.y = -((ev.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 2 + 1;\\n    };\\n\\n    const handlePointerMove = (ev: PointerEvent) => {\\n      const now = performance.now();\\n      if (now - lastMoveTs < 45) return;\\n      lastMoveTs = now;\\n      updatePointer(ev);\\n      raycaster.setFromCamera(pointerNdc, camera);\\n      const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(clickableProxies, false);\\n      const hit = hits.length > 0 ? (hits[0].object as THREE.Mesh) : null;\\n      if (hit !== hoveredProxy) {\\n        hoveredProxy = hit;\\n        renderer.domElement.style.cursor = hit ? \'pointer\' : \'grab\';\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    const handlePointerDown = (ev: PointerEvent) => {\\n      downX = ev.clientX;\\n      downY = ev.clientY;\\n    };\\n\\n    const handlePointerUp = (ev: PointerEvent) => {\\n      const dist = Math.hypot(ev.clientX - downX, ev.clientY - downY);\\n      if (dist > 6) return; // User orbited camera instead of clicking a station\\n      updatePointer(ev);\\n      raycaster.setFromCamera(pointerNdc, camera);\\n      const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(clickableProxies, false);\\n      if (hits.length > 0) {\\n        const stationId = String(hits[0].object.userData.stationId || \'\');\\n        const found = stationsRef.current.find((s) => s.id === stationId);\\n        if (found) {\\n          onSelectStationRef.current(found);\\n          cameraGoalRef.current = {\\n            active: true,\\n            pos: found.cameraPos,\\n            target: found.lookAt,\\n          };\\n        }\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    renderer.domElement.style.cursor = \'grab\';\\n    renderer.domElement.addEventListener(\'pointermove\', handlePointerMove);\\n    renderer.domElement.addEventListener(\'pointerdown\', handlePointerDown);\\n    renderer.domElement.addEventListener(\'pointerup\', handlePointerUp);\\n\\n    // Pre-warm shaders on real GPUs\\n    if (!isSoftwareGl) {\\n      renderer.compile(scene, camera);\\n    }\\n\\n    // --- 7. Responsive ResizeObserver ---\\n    const resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver((entries) => {\\n      const entry = entries[0];\\n      if (!entry) return;\\n      const w = Math.max(200, Math.floor(entry.contentRect.width));\\n      const h = Math.max(240, Math.floor(entry.contentRect.height));\\n      camera.aspect = w / h;\\n      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\\n      renderer.setSize(w, h);\\n    });\\n    resizeObserver.observe(container);\\n\\n    // --- 8. Animation Loop with Software-WebGL fenceSync Pacing ---\\n    const clock = new THREE.Clock();\\n    let frameId = 0;\\n    let disposed = false;\\n\\n    function afterDraw(cb: () => void) {\\n      const gl = renderer.getContext() as WebGL2RenderingContext;\\n      if (!gl || typeof gl.fenceSync !== \'function\') {\\n        frameId = window.setTimeout(cb, 85);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      const sync = gl.fenceSync(gl.SYNC_GPU_COMMANDS_COMPLETE, 0);\\n      gl.flush();\\n      const poll = () => {\\n        if (disposed) {\\n          if (sync) gl.deleteSync(sync);\\n          return;\\n        }\\n        const state = sync && gl.getSyncParameter(sync, gl.SYNC_STATUS);\\n        if (state === gl.UNSIGNALED) {\\n          frameId = window.setTimeout(poll, 5);\\n        } else {\\n          if (sync) gl.deleteSync(sync);\\n          frameId = window.setTimeout(cb, 80);\\n        }\\n      };\\n      frameId = window.setTimeout(poll, 5);\\n    }\\n\\n    function tick() {\\n      if (disposed) return;\\n      const delta = Math.min(0.08, clock.getDelta());\\n      const elapsed = clock.getElapsedTime();\\n\\n      // Gentle buoyant island float\\n      islandRoot.position.y = Math.sin(elapsed * 0.85) * 0.16;\\n\\n      // Side islets gentle drift\\n      for (const islet of sideIslets) {\\n        islet.mesh.position.y = islet.baseY + Math.sin(elapsed * 1.1 + islet.phase) * 0.22;\\n      }\\n\\n      // Drifting daylight clouds\\n      cloudGroup.rotation.y = elapsed * 0.025;\\n\\n      // Orbiting commit energy pods\\n      for (let i = 0; i < commitPods.length; i++) {\\n        const pod = commitPods[i];\\n        pod.angle += delta * pod.speed;\\n        pod.group.position.set(\\n          commitFrontierCenter.x + Math.cos(pod.angle) * pod.radius,\\n          commitFrontierCenter.y + pod.yOff + Math.sin(elapsed * 2.2 + i) * 0.14,\\n          commitFrontierCenter.z + Math.sin(pod.angle) * pod.radius\\n        );\\n        pod.group.rotation.y += delta * 1.1;\\n      }\\n\\n      // Celebration confetti physics\\n      if (celebrationActive) {\\n        let aliveCount = 0;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < PARTICLE_COUNT; i++) {\\n          const p = particles[i];\\n          if (p.life > 0) {\\n            aliveCount++;\\n            p.life -= delta;\\n            p.vel.y -= 9.2 * delta;\\n            p.pos.addScaledVector(p.vel, delta);\\n            p.rot.x += delta * 5.2;\\n            p.rot.y += delta * 4.4;\\n            const s = Math.max(0.01, Math.min(1, p.life));\\n            _dummyQuat.setFromEuler(p.rot);\\n            _dummyScale.set(s, s, s);\\n            _dummyMatrix.compose(p.pos, _dummyQuat, _dummyScale);\\n            confettiMesh.setMatrixAt(i, _dummyMatrix);\\n          } else {\\n            _dummyScale.set(0, 0, 0);\\n            _dummyMatrix.compose(p.pos, _dummyQuat, _dummyScale);\\n            confettiMesh.setMatrixAt(i, _dummyMatrix);\\n          }\\n        }\\n        confettiMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate = true;\\n        if (aliveCount === 0) {\\n          celebrationActive = false;\\n          confettiMesh.visible = false;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      // Smooth exponential damping for scripted camera presets / station focus\\n      if (cameraGoalRef.current.active) {\\n        _camGoalPos.set(...cameraGoalRef.current.pos);\\n        _camGoalTarget.set(...cameraGoalRef.current.target);\\n        camera.position.x = THREE.MathUtils.damp(camera.position.x, _camGoalPos.x, 4.5, delta);\\n        camera.position.y = THREE.MathUtils.damp(camera.position.y, _camGoalPos.y, 4.5, delta);\\n        camera.position.z = THREE.MathUtils.damp(camera.position.z, _camGoalPos.z, 4.5, delta);\\n\\n        controls.target.x = THREE.MathUtils.damp(controls.target.x, _camGoalTarget.x, 4.5, delta);\\n        controls.target.y = THREE.MathUtils.damp(controls.target.y, _camGoalTarget.y, 4.5, delta);\\n        controls.target.z = THREE.MathUtils.damp(controls.target.z, _camGoalTarget.z, 4.5, delta);\\n\\n        if (\\n          camera.position.distanceTo(_camGoalPos) < 0.08 &&\\n          controls.target.distanceTo(_camGoalTarget) < 0.08\\n        ) {\\n          cameraGoalRef.current.active = false;\\n        }\\n      } else if (autoRotateRef.current && !isSoftwareGl) {\\n        controls.autoRotate = true;\\n        controls.autoRotateSpeed = 0.65;\\n      } else {\\n        controls.autoRotate = false;\\n      }\\n\\n      controls.update();\\n      renderer.render(scene, camera);\\n\\n      if (isSoftwareGl) {\\n        afterDraw(tick);\\n      } else {\\n        frameId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    tick();\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      disposed = true;\\n      cancelAnimationFrame(frameId);\\n      clearTimeout(frameId);\\n      resizeObserver.disconnect();\\n      controls.removeEventListener(\'start\', onControlStart);\\n      controls.dispose();\\n      renderer.domElement.removeEventListener(\'webglcontextlost\', handleContextLost);\\n      renderer.domElement.removeEventListener(\'pointermove\', handlePointerMove);\\n      renderer.domElement.removeEventListener(\'pointerdown\', handlePointerDown);\\n      renderer.domElement.removeEventListener(\'pointerup\', handlePointerUp);\\n\\n      scene.traverse((obj) => {\\n        if ((obj as THREE.Mesh).isMesh) {\\n          const m = obj as THREE.Mesh;\\n          m.geometry?.dispose();\\n          if (Array.isArray(m.material)) {\\n            m.material.forEach((mat) => mat.dispose());\\n          } else {\\n            m.material?.dispose();\\n          }\\n        }\\n      });\\n      meadowTex.dispose();\\n      stripeTex.dispose();\\n      envTexture.dispose();\\n      renderer.dispose();\\n    };\\n  }, [snapshot.repo.fullName, snapshot.releases.length, snapshot.mergedPRs.length, snapshot.contributors.length, snapshot.commits.length]);\\n\\n  const handleCameraPreset = (presetId: CameraPresetId) => {\\n    setActivePreset(presetId);\\n    const preset = CAMERA_PRESETS[presetId];\\n    cameraGoalRef.current = {\\n      active: true,\\n      pos: preset.pos,\\n      target: preset.target,\\n    };\\n\\n    // Match a contextual station if switching to a specific zone\\n    if (presetId === \'overview\') {\\n      setSelectedStation(null);\\n    } else if (presetId === \'releases\') {\\n      setSelectedStation(stations.find((s) => s.kind === \'release\') || null);\\n    } else if (presetId === \'prs\') {\\n      setSelectedStation(stations.find((s) => s.kind === \'pr\') || null);\\n    } else if (presetId === \'commits\') {\\n      setSelectedStation(stations.find((s) => s.kind === \'commit\') || null);\\n    } else if (presetId === \'contributors\') {\\n      setSelectedStation(stations.find((s) => s.kind === \'contributor\') || null);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"relative h-[430px] sm:h-[500px] lg:h-[540px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#E6F3FA]\\\">\\n      {/* Isolated WebGL mount container */}\\n      {!webglUnavailable ? (\\n        <div ref={mountRef} className=\\\"h-full w-full\\\" aria-label=\\\"Interactive 3D Floating Island Roadmap\\\" />\\n      ) : (\\n        <div className=\\\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-4xl\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            \360\237\217\235\357\270\217\\n          </span>\\n          <h3 className=\\\"mt-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#0F172A]\\\">\\n            3D Floating Island Preview Unavailable\\n          </h3>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 max-w-md text-sm text-slate-600\\\">\\n            WebGL is disabled in this browser environment, but all live commits, charts, and AI\\n            community updates remain fully interactive below.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Minimal Top-Left Scene Title (no side cards blocking center!) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute top-4 left-4 z-10 max-w-[calc(100%-2rem)]\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white/95 px-3.5 py-2 shadow-sm\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#0F172A]\\\">\\n            \360\237\217\235\357\270\217 {snapshot.repo.name} Lifecycle Island\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-slate-300\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            \302\267\\n          </span>\\n          <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">\\n            Drag to orbit \302\267 Click any lighthouse, pavilion, or orb\\n          </span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Selected Landmark Inspector (compact, clean solid surface\342\200\224no backdrop-blur over WebGL) */}\\n      {selectedStation && (\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute top-16 left-4 z-20 w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-xs rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xl shrink-0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                {selectedStation.emoji}\\n              </span>\\n              <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                <h4 className=\\\"font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#0F172A] truncate\\\">\\n                  {selectedStation.title}\\n                </h4>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#0D9488] truncate\\\">\\n                  {selectedStation.subtitle}\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setSelectedStation(null)}\\n              aria-label=\\\"Close landmark inspector\\\"\\n              className=\\\"rounded-lg p-1 text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <X className=\\\"h-4 w-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">{selectedStation.detail}</p>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">{selectedStation.meta}</p>\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() =>\\n                onAskAboutStation(\\n                  `Can you explain this milestone in simple everyday terms: \\\"${selectedStation.title}\\\" (${selectedStation.subtitle})?`,\\n                  selectedStation.title\\n                )\\n              }\\n              className=\\\"inline-flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#FF5A5F] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#E0484D] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <MessageCircle className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Ask AI</span>\\n            </button>\\n            <a\\n              href={selectedStation.url}\\n              target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n              rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\"\\n              className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span>GitHub</span>\\n              <ExternalLink className=\\\"h-3 w-3\\\" />\\n            </a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Unified Collapsible Bottom Control Dock (Zero Viewport Occlusion) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-3 left-1/2 z-20 flex -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center max-w-[94%]\\\">\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => setDockCollapsed((v) => !v)}\\n          className=\\\"mb-1.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600 shadow-sm hover:text-[#0F172A] transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n        >\\n          {dockCollapsed ? (\\n            <>\\n              <ChevronUp className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Show Island Controls</span>\\n            </>\\n          ) : (\\n            <>\\n              <ChevronDown className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Hide Controls</span>\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {!dockCollapsed && (\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/95 p-1.5 shadow-md shadow-slate-900/8\\\">\\n            {(Object.keys(CAMERA_PRESETS) as CameraPresetId[]).map((presetId) => {\\n              const active = activePreset === presetId;\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={presetId}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => handleCameraPreset(presetId)}\\n                  className={`rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                    active\\n                      ? \'bg-[#0F172A] text-white\'\\n                      : \'text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-[#0F172A]\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {CAMERA_PRESETS[presetId].label}\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"mx-1 hidden h-5 w-px bg-slate-200 sm:block\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setAutoRotate((v) => !v)}\\n              className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n                autoRotate\\n                  ? \'bg-[#0D9488]/12 text-[#0D9488]\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <RotateCw className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>{autoRotate ? \'Orbit On\' : \'Orbit Off\'}</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => burstTriggerRef.current()}\\n              className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FF5A5F]/12 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#FF5A5F] hover:bg-[#FF5A5F]/20 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <PartyPopper className=\\\"h-3.5 w-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>Celebrate</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create interactive Three.js Floating Island Roadmap with composite procedural landmarks, RoomEnvironment PBR, software-WebGL guard, raycasting, exponential camera damping, confetti bursts, and collapsible bottom dock.\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/FloatingIsland3D.tsx\"}"
