  planner_response {
    response: "**PulseIsle** is built and running! Here is an overview of what\342\200\231s ready to explore:\n\n- **Sunlit Search Launcher & Curated Picks**: Paste any full GitHub repository URL (`https://github.com/owner/repo`) or `owner/repo` handle, or jump straight into curated open-source repos (`facebook/react`, `vercel/next.js`, `vitejs/vite`, `mrdoob/three.js`) with recent repo history saved automatically.\n- **Plain-English AI Community Briefings**: Powered server-side by Gemini, every repository loads with an upbeat community headline, translated release highlights, and jargon-free summaries for recent commits and merged pull requests\342\200\224complete with segmented filters (`All`, `Merged PRs`, `Commits`), live search, and a toggle to peek at original technical titles.\n- **Interactive 3D Floating Island Roadmap (Three.js)**: Explore releases as striped lighthouse beacons, merged PRs as coastal workshop pavilions, top contributors in Builders Plaza, and recent commits as orbiting energy pods. Drag to orbit, click any 3D station to inspect it or ask AI about it, switch camera presets from the collapsible bottom dock, and trigger celebratory confetti bursts.\n- **Animated Velocity Charts & Contributors**: Interactive area and bar charts track commit and merged PR momentum alongside animated milestone progress bars and a top-contributors leaderboard.\n- **60-Second Auto-Sync & Milestone Push Notifications**: Automatically checks GitHub every 60 seconds using ETag conditional caching to detect fresh commits, merged PRs, and releases. Includes Pause/Resume, manual Sync Now, opt-in browser push alerts, playful in-app milestone banners, and a **Test Milestone Alert** trigger.\n- **Streaming Community AI Chat**: Open the responsive slide-over chat drawer from the header or any commit, release, or 3D landmark to ask questions in plain English and get live streaming explanations grounded in the active repository."
    thinking: "**Analyzing GitHub Response**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got a live response from `vitejs/vite`! It\'s loaded with all the juicy details - stars, forks, issues, avatar, and topics. I\'m now double-checking the requirements to be absolutely sure I haven\'t missed a single thing. So far, the GitHub repo tracker aspect seems solid.\n\n\n**Refining Data Extraction**\n\nI\'ve confirmed I have all the key data points from the GitHub response, like real-time activity metrics, release notes, and contributor stats. My focus is now on ensuring the AI summaries are clear, concise, and provide actionable takeaways for each commit and pull request. I\'m also fine-tuning the auto-sync feature for efficiency and rate-limit compliance.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "OsoCa6H9LrrtvMcP5cvjWA"
    modified_response: "**PulseIsle** is built and running! Here is an overview of what\342\200\231s ready to explore:\n\n- **Sunlit Search Launcher & Curated Picks**: Paste any full GitHub repository URL (`https://github.com/owner/repo`) or `owner/repo` handle, or jump straight into curated open-source repos (`facebook/react`, `vercel/next.js`, `vitejs/vite`, `mrdoob/three.js`) with recent repo history saved automatically.\n- **Plain-English AI Community Briefings**: Powered server-side by Gemini, every repository loads with an upbeat community headline, translated release highlights, and jargon-free summaries for recent commits and merged pull requests\342\200\224complete with segmented filters (`All`, `Merged PRs`, `Commits`), live search, and a toggle to peek at original technical titles.\n- **Interactive 3D Floating Island Roadmap (Three.js)**: Explore releases as striped lighthouse beacons, merged PRs as coastal workshop pavilions, top contributors in Builders Plaza, and recent commits as orbiting energy pods. Drag to orbit, click any 3D station to inspect it or ask AI about it, switch camera presets from the collapsible bottom dock, and trigger celebratory confetti bursts.\n- **Animated Velocity Charts & Contributors**: Interactive area and bar charts track commit and merged PR momentum alongside animated milestone progress bars and a top-contributors leaderboard.\n- **60-Second Auto-Sync & Milestone Push Notifications**: Automatically checks GitHub every 60 seconds using ETag conditional caching to detect fresh commits, merged PRs, and releases. Includes Pause/Resume, manual Sync Now, opt-in browser push alerts, playful in-app milestone banners, and a **Test Milestone Alert** trigger.\n- **Streaming Community AI Chat**: Open the responsive slide-over chat drawer from the header or any commit, release, or 3D landmark to ask questions in plain English and get live streaming explanations grounded in the active repository."
