  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Core Issue**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the critical aspect: the user\'s experience stems from two key findings. `gemini-4-hydrogen` delivers excellent playful JSON, but the raw commit messages appearing instead of AI summaries point to an issue. Specifically, I suspect it\'s a rendering problem in `ActivityFeed.tsx` where it renders `snapshot` instead of the expected AI summaries. This is what\'s causing the problem.\n\n\n**Refining the Output Structure**\n\nI\'m now focused on refining how the AI summary is structured. Previously, the system was displaying raw commit messages due to a rendering issue in `ActivityFeed.tsx`. Now, I\'m working to upgrade `/api/ai/summarize` to generate a rich, structured AI Community Progress Report. This includes an upbeat headline and playful summary, followed by thematic chapters that synthesize recent commits and PRs. These chapters, such as \"Speed Upgrades\" or \"New Features,\" will offer a plain-English perspective on the changes, aiming to provide a concise and informative user experience.\n\n\n**Structuring the Progress Report**\n\nI\'m now expanding the AI-generated report\'s structure to provide a much richer, more user-friendly experience. I am adding fields like `emoji`, `title`, and a two-sentence `summary` for a quick overview. I am also working on `impactLevel`, `keyWins` (bullet points), and `relatedCount` for each thematic chapter. Furthermore, I\'m integrating a `jargonDecoder` for plain-English explanations, lifecycle stage briefs for our new 3D pipeline, and translation fields. Finally, I\'m improving the UI during AI processing to show a \"Translating Progress\" state.\n\n\n**Defining View Modes**\n\nI\'m now determining the default user experience, which will be the \"AI Story Summary\" showcasing thematic chapters, a jargon decoder, and plain-English highlights. I\'m also adding an optional \"Simplified Changelog\" view, with each commit and PR translated by the AI and an \"Inspect Technical Log\" option. Moreover, I am replacing the floating island with a 3D interactive project lifecycle pipeline that uses real data from the repository.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Pipeline**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the 3D pipeline visualization within the UI. I have begun designing distinct 3D models to represent each lifecycle stage. Stage 2, \"Peer Review & Merge,\" will feature a \"Merge Archway Gate\". Stage 3, \"Community Engine,\" will be a Kinetic Velocity Gyroscope with contributor monuments. Finally, Stage 4, \"Public Launch,\" is to be a Release Milestone Podium & Progress Ring. Each stage will also have dynamically rendered labels to highlight active commits.\n\n\n**Implementing Stage Synchronization**\n\nI\'m now integrating synchronized interactions. Clicking a 3D structure, badge, or dock now focuses the camera on the corresponding lifecycle stage. Furthermore, I\'ve developed an \"AI Plain-English Stage Guide\" that explains each stage of open-source development, complete with a button to query the AI. Finally, I\'ve implemented a resilient caching and auto-sync mechanism to prevent API rate limiting, which ensures seamless repository switching.\n\n\n**Caching for Optimized Efficiency**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing performance improvements. I\'ve implemented efficient caching strategies. If GitHub returns a `304 Not Modified` status, or the SHA matches the cached snapshot, it\'s served immediately, saving on API calls. Furthermore, I\'m caching the Gemini `AiDigest` server-side, keyed by repo details, allowing instant retrieval of AI summaries. I\'m also preparing to update files in batches.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "79ECa6LtNNS5vMcPhPeGkAE"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4012610469938697449"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export interface RepoMetadata {\\n  owner: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  fullName: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  stars: number;\\n  forks: number;\\n  openIssues: number;\\n  watchers: number;\\n  language: string;\\n  defaultBranch: string;\\n  pushedAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  htmlUrl: string;\\n  avatarUrl: string;\\n  topics: string[];\\n  license: string | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CommitItem {\\n  sha: string;\\n  shortSha: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  firstLine: string;\\n  authorName: string;\\n  authorLogin: string;\\n  authorAvatar: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  htmlUrl: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PullRequestItem {\\n  number: number;\\n  title: string;\\n  userLogin: string;\\n  userAvatar: string;\\n  mergedAt: string;\\n  htmlUrl: string;\\n  labels: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReleaseItem {\\n  id: number;\\n  tagName: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  publishedAt: string;\\n  body: string;\\n  htmlUrl: string;\\n  authorLogin: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ContributorItem {\\n  login: string;\\n  avatarUrl: string;\\n  contributions: number;\\n  htmlUrl: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface VelocityPoint {\\n  label: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  commits: number;\\n  mergedPRs: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RepoSnapshot {\\n  repo: RepoMetadata;\\n  commits: CommitItem[];\\n  mergedPRs: PullRequestItem[];\\n  releases: ReleaseItem[];\\n  contributors: ContributorItem[];\\n  velocitySeries: VelocityPoint[];\\n  syncedAt: string;\\n  rateLimitRemaining: number | null;\\n  cached: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type ChangeCategory = \'Feature\' | \'Fix\' | \'Speed\' | \'Docs\' | \'Polish\';\\n\\nexport interface CommitTranslation {\\n  sha: string;\\n  emoji: string;\\n  plainTitle: string;\\n  whyItMatters: string;\\n  category: ChangeCategory;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PrTranslation {\\n  number: number;\\n  emoji: string;\\n  plainTitle: string;\\n  whyItMatters: string;\\n  category: ChangeCategory;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReleaseHighlight {\\n  emoji: string;\\n  text: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReleaseTranslation {\\n  tagName: string;\\n  cheerfulTitle: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  highlights: ReleaseHighlight[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProgressChapter {\\n  emoji: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  impactLabel: string;\\n  keyWins: string[];\\n  relatedCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface JargonTerm {\\n  term: string;\\n  plainMeaning: string;\\n  emoji: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LifecycleStageBriefs {\\n  commits: string;\\n  prs: string;\\n  community: string;\\n  release: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AiDigest {\\n  headline: string;\\n  playfulSummary: string;\\n  momentumMood: string;\\n  momentumEmoji: string;\\n  nextMilestoneEstimate: string;\\n  milestoneProgressPct: number;\\n  progressChapters: ProgressChapter[];\\n  jargonDecoder: JargonTerm[];\\n  lifecycleStageBriefs: LifecycleStageBriefs;\\n  releaseTranslation: ReleaseTranslation | null;\\n  commitTranslations: CommitTranslation[];\\n  prTranslations: PrTranslation[];\\n  generatedAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ChatMessage {\\n  id: string;\\n  role: \'user\' | \'assistant\';\\n  content: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  contextLabel?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MilestoneAlert {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: \'commit\' | \'pr\' | \'release\' | \'celebration\';\\n  title: string;\\n  body: string;\\n  emoji: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  isSimulated?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport type LifecycleStageId = \'commits\' | \'prs\' | \'community\' | \'release\';\\n\\nexport interface LifecycleStageInfo {\\n  id: LifecycleStageId;\\n  stepNumber: number;\\n  label: string;\\n  metricText: string;\\n  emoji: string;\\n  whatThisStageMeans: string;\\n  liveSummary: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  cameraPos: [number, number, number];\\n  lookAt: [number, number, number];\\n  worldAnchor: [numbe